    "Trade and smuggling": "Comercio y contrabando",
    "no goods to buy and sell between towns, no contraband.": "sin mercancías que comprar y vender entre ciudades, sin contrabando.",
    "Property and businesses": "Inmuebles y negocios",
    "you cannot buy houses to rent out or open a business.": "no puedes comprar casas para alquilar ni abrir un negocio.",
    "Banks and moneylenders": "Bancos y prestamistas",
