    "Mounts": "Monturas",
    "no horses or other mounts to ride.": "sin caballos ni otras monturas.",
    "Crime and prison": "Crimen y cárcel",
    "no stealing, arrests or prison.": "sin robos, arrestos ni cárcel.",
    "Towers": "Torres",
    "no endless towers to climb.": "sin torres infinitas que escalar.",
    "Sentient weapons": "Armas sintientes",
    "no weapons with a will of their own.": "sin armas con voluntad propia.",
    "Crafting and gems": "Fabricación y gemas",
    "nothing to craft, no gems to set.": "nada que fabricar, ninguna gema que engastar.",
    "no trophies from great foes.": "sin trofeos de grandes enemigos.",
    "Hunting contracts": "Contratos de caza",
    "no contracts to hunt monsters and outlaws.": "sin contratos para cazar monstruos y forajidos.",
